    "SwiftNZB deletes the partly downloaded files." : {

    },
    "SwiftNZB is a native client for the Usenet (NNTP) protocol. Bring your own provider account and your own NZB files. PAR2 verification and repair is a clean-room implementation. RAR extraction uses the UnRAR library." : {

    },
    "SwiftNZB ships no content and no search. You are responsible for what you download, and it should only be material you have the right to." : {

